    "id": "2714295",
    "original": "トムの学校では、タトエバが大流行して学業に支障が出ているため、緊急職員会議が開かれて、生徒の例文の投稿は一日30文までとする措置が取られることになったが、学校側で生徒のアカウントを把握しきれていないこともあり、対策は難航している。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "12595133",
        "text": "At Tom's school, the Tatoeba craze has become so widespread that it's affecting students' studies. As a result, an emergency staff meeting was held and it was decided to limit students to submitting no more than 30 example sentences per day. However, since the school hasn't fully tracked the students' accounts, implementing this measure has proven challenging."
